{
    "title": "My Premise Health",
    "description": "My Premise Health is a secure mobile app that puts your health information in your hands. Real-time appointment scheduling, view lab results, check vitals, message your provider, manage medications, mobile video visits, complete forms and more from one place.\r\n\r\nWith My Premise Health you can:\r\n        View your health record\r\n        Book and manage appointments\r\n        Message your providers and care team\r\n        View lab and test results\r\n        View current medications and refill prescriptions \r\n        Conduct virtual visits\r\n        Complete forms and eCheck-In\r\n        View billing history, statements and make payment online\r\n        View your immunization history and health reminders\r\n        Manage your dependent\u2019s health information \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s never been easier to get, stay and be well.\r\n\r\nTo use the app and access your health information, you must first create an account through your healthcare provider or have an active My Premise Health account. \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t have an account yet? Contact your health center directly or sign up at www.mypremisehealth.com and click \u201csign up now\u201d.",
    "descriptionHTML": "My Premise Health is a secure mobile app that puts your health information in your hands. Real-time appointment scheduling, view lab results, check vitals, message your provider, manage medications, mobile video visits, complete forms and more from one place.<br><br>With My Premise Health you can:<br>        View your health record<br>        Book and manage appointments<br>        Message your providers and care team<br>        View lab and test results<br>        View current medications and refill prescriptions <br>        Conduct virtual visits<br>        Complete forms and eCheck-In<br>        View billing history, statements and make payment online<br>        View your immunization history and health reminders<br>        Manage your dependent\u2019s health information <br><br>It\u2019s never been easier to get, stay and be well.<br><br>To use the app and access your health information, you must first create an account through your healthcare provider or have an active My Premise Health account. <br><br>Don\u2019t have an account yet? Contact your health center directly or sign up at www.mypremisehealth.com and click \u201csign up now\u201d.",
